==Strategy==
You could spam meatshields and [[Dragon Cat]], and also use the [[Cat Cannon]] to sync up the Rain Ds if there's more than one on screen. Or you could just use a single [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to juggle the Rain Ds, and some Research combos too (not recommended but you could if you want.)

